<title>USA: U.S. T-bond spikes over one point higher after CPI.</title>
<headline>U.S. T-bond spikes over one point higher after CPI.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the benchmark 30-year U.S. Treasury bond leapt after the Labor Department reported the March Consumer Price Index (CPI) rose a smaller-than-expected 0.1 percent.</p>
</text>
